      "content": "what do you mean by \"stop being in the situation\"? i don't mean like moving away or something. i mean that everything is just so fundamentally broken because of me. it feels like the only way to actually stop hurting them is to just... not be a factor in their lives anymore. it's like, if i wasn't here, they could finally breathe again.",
