      "content": "i know, i know... i've heard about the hotlines. but they just tell you things will get better or that you're not a burden, but that's just something people say to be nice. it doesn't change the reality of how much i've messed things up. if i'm just a net negative in their lives, isn't it actually more selfish to keep clinging to them when my absence would give them peace? like, isn't there a kind of mercy in just letting go?",
